# ============================================================
#  COPY THIS FILE TO ".env" AND ADD YOUR OWN OPENAI API KEY.
#
#  This project does NOT include anyone's key. Each user must
#  use their own key. Get one at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
#  Your .env file is gitignored and will NEVER be uploaded.
